    "The feed supplement contains magnesium carbonate, which supports muscle and nerve function, and calcium carbonate, which is important for bone health and teeth strength in young pets. Magnesium, calcium and the MicroZeoGen mineral help to maintain healthy bone formation, strengthen teeth and support joint mobility, and these trace elements also ensure the healthy growth and development of young pets. Combined into one, these substances make a high-quality feed supplement that can help ensure better health for your growing pet.",
